===Okami Honda branch (Yamanaka Lineage)===
This tree shows the descendants of Yamanaka Nobutaka. His eldest son Shigenari became the 9th Shogun. His second son Shigemasa remained head of the Yamanaka family. When Shigenari died childless, Shigemasa's son Shigeharu was adopted back to become the 10th Shogun.

